SUMMARY:Meet Positron: A Guided Tour for RStudio Users - R-Ladies+ Melbourne
DESCRIPTION:**Meet Positron: A Guided Tour for RStudio Users**\n\n**Date:** 30th July, 2026\n**Time:** 11 AM\n**Where: [Online](https://deakin.zoom.us/j/87455019351?pwd=mvadykmUlN0OsEFj8IrBMrGZHbkIuV.1&from=addon)**\n\nCurious about Positron but not sure where to start? This session is the perfect opportunity to explore the next generation of data science development in a relaxed, beginner-friendly environment.\n\nIf you're already comfortable using RStudio, we'll help you get your bearings in Positron by highlighting what's familiar, what's different, and some of the features that make it an exciting new option for R users.\n\nNo prior experience with Positron is needed - just bring your curiosity!\n\nWhether you're an experienced R user or have only recently started your R journey, this is a great chance to discover what Positron has to offer alongside fellow members of the R-Ladies+ Melbourne community.\n\n**We look forward to exploring Positron with you!**
LOCATION:Online event
URL:https://www.meetup.com/rladies-melbourne/events/315661884/
ORGANIZER;CN=R-Ladies+ Melbourne:mailto:info@rladies.org
CATEGORIES:RLadies+,R-Ladies+ Melbourne
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SEQUENCE:0
END:VEVENTBEGIN:VEVENT
